{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47288","headline":"览古十四首 一 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人重周济，明道欲救时。\n孔席不暇暖，墨突何尝缁。\n兴言振颓纲，将以有所维。\n君臣恣淫惑，风俗日凋衰。\n三代业遽陨，七雄遂交驰。\n庶物坠涂炭，区中若棼丝。\n秦皇燎儒术，方册靡孑遗。\n大汉历五叶，斯文复崇推。\n乃验经籍道，与世同屯夷。\n弛张固天意，设教安能持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}